import{_ as t,o as n,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 711 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Overview — The Transcended Ones' Perpetual-Construction System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 711 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Overview — The Transcended Ones' Perpetual-Construction System","no":711,"module":4,"tags":["Post Duties","Overview","Perpetual Construction","Post System","Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm"],"related":["17-Plane-Transcendent Standard","49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances","01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0711_模块4-岗位职责总论.md","filePath":"en/0711_模块4-岗位职责总论.md"}`),a={name:"en/0711_模块4-岗位职责总论.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,c,h){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-711-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-overview-—-the-transcended-ones-perpetual-construction-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 711 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Overview — The Transcended Ones&#39; Perpetual-Construction System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-711-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-overview-—-the-transcended-ones-perpetual-construction-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 711 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Overview — The Transcended Ones&#39; Perpetual-Construction System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 17, 49, 01</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-a-transcended-one-is-not-a-title-but-a-post-table" tabindex="-1">Introduction: a transcended one is not a title, but a post table <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-a-transcended-one-is-not-a-title-but-a-post-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: a transcended one is not a title, but a post table&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The first three groups of Module Four (701–710) have fully explained &quot;what true transcendence is.&quot; Starting at Entry 711, we enter the operational layer: what does a true transcended one specifically do? The answer is a <strong>nine-post table</strong>. These nine posts are not civilizational moral kidnapping, but the physical needs of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law network — the law network has nine pits that must be filled; those who fill the pits are the transcended ones.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry converge into post-design principles: the anti-predation axiom requires all posts&#39; outputs be increments, not plunder; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires posts be open to all beings and post outputs serve all beings; the collective ascension axiom requires the nine posts form a closed loop jointly driving Myriad-Rank uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires every post&#39;s operation have a reporting procedure; the law-first axiom requires the nine posts&#39; definitions stable, infinitely scalable, and not increased or decreased for plot needs.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-overview-of-the-nine-posts" tabindex="-1">I. Overview of the Nine Posts <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-overview-of-the-nine-posts" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Overview of the Nine Posts&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Post No.</th><th>Post Name</th><th>Core Duty</th><th>Entry</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Law-Network Maintenance Post</td><td>Anchor calibration, law-drift detection, law-sector homeostasis</td><td>712</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Myriad-Rank Evolution Guidance Post</td><td>Cultivation-path design for each clan, late-bloomer training, talent matching</td><td>713</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Cross-Plane Anchor Construction Post</td><td>New-plane onboarding, anchor hardware deployment, plane-coordinate master library maintenance</td><td>714</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Alaya-Network Supervision Post</td><td>Consciousness-domain data security, consensus audit, anomalous-behavior identification</td><td>715</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Civilizational-Correction and Historical-Reversal-Prevention Post</td><td>Cross-plane causal-anomaly review, regression-tendency identification, correction contingency plans</td><td>716</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Increment-Development and Resource-Creation Post</td><td>New energy-source development, new manual iteration, new civilizational-engineering design</td><td>717</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Myriad-Rank Republican Deliberation Coordination Post</td><td>Cross-race dispute mediation, Council-representative liaison, consensus crystallization</td><td>718</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>New-Cosmos Frontier and Law-Weaving Post</td><td>New-cosmos exploration, new-law weaving, new-law testing</td><td>719</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post</td><td>Next-generation plane-transcendent strong-ones cultivation, post-successor selection</td><td>720</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The nine posts are not nine isolated departments, but a <strong>mutually meshing gear network</strong>: the maintenance post finds drift; the correction post judges its nature; the increment post provides schemes; the frontier post provides test fields; the guidance post teaches schemes to Myriad Ranks; the supervision post watches the whole board; the coordination post handles disputes; the training post passes new methods to the next generation; the deliberation post makes all this public to Myriad-Rank representatives.</p><h2 id="ii-four-principles-of-post-design" tabindex="-1">II. Four Principles of Post Design <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-four-principles-of-post-design" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Four Principles of Post Design&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-perpetual-post-system" tabindex="-1">2.1 Perpetual-Post System <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-perpetual-post-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Perpetual-Post System&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The nine posts have no concept of &quot;retirement.&quot; After entering the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, a transcended one may work one post for one civilizational cycle then apply to rotate, but may not abandon the post itself. This stamps out lie-flat-style transcendence of &quot;work a few hundred years then go home to retire.&quot;</p><h3 id="_2-2-multi-person-per-post-system" tabindex="-1">2.2 Multi-Person-Per-Post System <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-multi-person-per-post-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Multi-Person-Per-Post System&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Each post is jointly borne by multiple transcended ones, forming internal checks. No single transcended one may alone decide a post&#39;s major operation — this corresponds to Document 49&#39;s governance framework: four-power separation of legislation (Anchor Council), executive (Symbiotic Executive Committee), judiciary (Symbiotic Court), supervision (Anchor Supervisory Committee) applies equally at the transcended-ones level.</p><h3 id="_2-3-post-rotation-system" tabindex="-1">2.3 Post-Rotation System <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-post-rotation-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Post-Rotation System&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Transcended ones rotate among posts, avoiding long-term &quot;department interests&quot; forming on one post. A person switching from law-maintenance post to Alaya-supervision post deepens his understanding of the law network from both &quot;internal&quot; and &quot;external&quot; perspectives. This rotation itself is cultivation — the horizontal flow of post experience feeds back into his personal Dao.</p><h3 id="_2-4-performance-public-system" tabindex="-1">2.4 Performance-Public System <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-4-performance-public-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.4 Performance-Public System&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Each post&#39;s performance is public to Myriad-Rank representatives through the civilizational-weight panel. The Myriad-Rank Republican Council may periodically review each post&#39;s output, cost, and risk; any post whose performance declines for two consecutive cycles triggers a post interview. This turns the transcended ones&#39; work from &quot;closed-door cultivation&quot; into &quot;public service.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-the-nine-posts-linkage-with-the-myriad-origin-two-way-cycle" tabindex="-1">III. The Nine Posts&#39; Linkage with the Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-nine-posts-linkage-with-the-myriad-origin-two-way-cycle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Nine Posts&#39; Linkage with the Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The nine posts jointly serve one ultimate closed loop: the <strong>Myriad-Origin two-way cycle</strong>.</p><ul><li>The maintenance, supervision, and correction posts are responsible for &quot;guarding&quot; the cycle against predatory factions, historical reversal, and law drift;</li><li>The guidance, training, and deliberation posts are responsible for &quot;unclogging&quot; the cycle, letting Myriad Ranks&#39; origin energy flow more smoothly into the public pool;</li><li>The increment, frontier, and cross-plane posts are responsible for &quot;expanding&quot; the cycle, developing new energy sources, new planes, and new cosmoses, so the cycle&#39;s total flow continuously grows.</li></ul><p>Three post types exert three forces, stretching the cycle larger and steadier. This is the post-study expression of &quot;perpetual construction&quot;: not some one transcended one moving, but nine posts continuously doing work in the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, spinning faster and steadier.</p><h2 id="iv-the-relationship-between-posts-and-protagonist-uniqueness-dependency-degree" tabindex="-1">IV. The Relationship Between Posts and Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependency Degree <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-relationship-between-posts-and-protagonist-uniqueness-dependency-degree" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Relationship Between Posts and Protagonist-Uniqueness Dependency Degree&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Module Two has repeatedly argued: old web novels&#39; malady is excessive protagonist-uniqueness dependency. The nine-post design structurally presses this dependency to &quot;extremely low&quot;:</p><ul><li>The nine posts are jointly borne by multiple transcended ones; if any one transcended one leaves, others fill in;</li><li>Post content is all public in the Selfless-Dao public library; any capable cultivator may learn, prepare, and take over;</li><li>Post lineage is institutionalized through the training post, not relying on some strong one &quot;fancying whoever to pass on.&quot;</li></ul><p>This means: <strong>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s civilizational security is not bet on any one person.</strong> Lin Hao is the first-generation anchor, but he is not irreplaceable — the successor he trains will take over him; the successor&#39;s successor will take over the successor. This is true Myriad-Rank Republicanism&#39;s landing at the transcended-ones level.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the nine posts direct every Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm transcended one&#39;s computing power to concrete civilizational engineering, stamping out any form of computing idling</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: post design explicitly requires incremental development and forbids stock predation; any post operation must go through Alaya-Network + multi-layer supervision audit</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style civilization is held up by one protagonist; Heng Yuan Zhou-style civilization is held up by the nine-post network — with the protagonist absent, the network still runs</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the nine posts are open to all Myriad-Rank beings; post outputs serve 99% of clans</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: post manuals, post performance, post-training materials are all public in the Selfless-Dao public library</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A transcended one is not a title, but a post table. The nine posts mesh with each other, perpetually rotate, and perform publicly, nailing the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s living anchors onto every key node of the law network. They do not retire, do not lie flat, do not monopolize — they work. This is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s post-study answer to &quot;perpetual construction.&quot;</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Transcendent Standard</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">Entry 49 · Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">Entry 22 · Resource-Allocation Joint-Contracting Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const y=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,y as default};
